<section class="ll-config" data-audience-desk><h2>Audience desk</h2><p>Know who’s watching. Follow the conversation.</p><div class="ll-grid"><div><h3>Lightek community</h3><p data-audience-status>Start a Lightek or simulcast broadcast to see its audience here.</p><ul data-live-viewers></ul><ol data-live-comments aria-live="polite"></ol><p>Counts cover signed-in Lightek playback in the last 45 seconds. Session participants appear separately in the session source.</p><h3>Session conversation</h3><ol data-session-messages aria-live="polite"></ol></div><div><h3>Social channels · Restream</h3><% if @restream_chat_url %><iframe src="<%= @restream_chat_url %>" title="Restream chat from supported social channels" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin" style="width:100%;height:420px;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:12px;background:#10201e"></iframe><% else %><p>Connect your Restream chat embed below to read supported channels here.</p><% end %><p><a href="https://chat.restream.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Restream Chat & reply ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/tiktokstudio/live" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open TikTok LIVE controls ↗</a></p><p><strong>Restream does not supply TikTok comments; connect the direct TikTok reader below.</strong> The reader shows available comments, join events, gifts, likes, and viewer-count updates. Named arrivals are recent observed events, not a complete current viewer roster. TikTok LIVE controls remain available as a fallback.</p><p><a href="https://support.restream.io/en/articles/2388185-read-incoming-chat-messages" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supported chat platforms ↗</a></p><details><summary>Connect / replace Restream chat</summary><p>In <a href="https://chat.restream.io/settings/embed" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Restream Chat → Settings → Embed in stream</a>, copy the embed URL. It is saved separately from your working streaming destination. The embedded view is for reading; open Restream Chat to reply.</p><%= form_with url: dashboard_live_audience_settings_path, method: :post, local: true, data: {turbo: false} do %><label>Restream embed URL<%= password_field_tag :chat_embed_url, nil, autocomplete: 'new-password', placeholder: 'https://chat.restream.io/embed?…' %></label><%= submit_tag 'Connect audience chat' %><% end %></details></div></div><div class="ll-grid"><article><h3>Direct TikTok LIVE audience</h3><p>Connect by your @username while you’re live. This uses TikTok-Live-Connector separately from the working Restream video feed.</p><%= form_with url: dashboard_live_audience_settings_path, local: true, data: {turbo: false} do %><label>TikTok username<%= text_field_tag :tiktok_username, nil, placeholder: '@yourname', maxlength: 25, required: true %></label><details><summary>Optional connector signing service key</summary><p>No official TikTok API key is required for public events. The connector uses a third-party signing service; its access or rate limits may require a provider key.</p><%= password_field_tag :sign_api_key, nil, autocomplete: 'new-password' %></details><%= submit_tag 'Save TikTok audience connection' %><% end %><button type="button" data-social-connect="tiktok">Connect TikTok audience</button><button type="button" data-social-stop="tiktok">Disconnect</button><p role="status" data-social-state="tiktok">Not connected</p><p data-social-count="tiktok">Viewer count not received</p><ol data-social-feed="tiktok" aria-live="polite"></ol></article><article><h3>Social Stream Ninja</h3><p>Use your existing SSN extension/app to aggregate TikTok and other channels. Enable “remote API control” and “Send chat messages to API server” in SSN mechanics, then connect its session here. Keep SSN and the source platform page running.</p><%= form_with url: dashboard_live_audience_settings_path, local: true, data: {turbo: false} do %><label>SSN session ID<%= password_field_tag :ssn_session, nil, required: true, autocomplete: 'new-password' %></label><%= submit_tag 'Save SSN connection' %><% end %><button type="button" data-social-connect="ssn">Connect aggregated chat</button><button type="button" data-social-stop="ssn">Disconnect</button><p role="status" data-social-state="ssn">Not connected</p><ol data-social-feed="ssn" aria-live="polite"></ol></article></div>
</section>
